# Flight data providers — ALL OPTIONAL.
#
# Wingman works completely with none of these set. The resolver falls back to a
# bundled worldwide airport dataset plus a deterministic synthetic schedule
# generator, so airport search and trip creation work offline, everywhere.
# Adding a key upgrades accuracy; it does not unlock functionality.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill in whichever you have.

# AeroDataBox — best schedule coverage. Tried first.
# https://rapidapi.com/aedbx-aedbx/api/aerodatabox
VITE_AERODATABOX_KEY=

# AviationStack — free tier is 100 calls/MONTH. The budget guard in
# providers/flights/budget.ts stops non-user-initiated refreshes at 80%.
# https://aviationstack.com/
VITE_AVIATIONSTACK_KEY=

# OpenSky — live positions only, no schedules. Free with an account.
# https://opensky-network.org/
VITE_OPENSKY_USER=
VITE_OPENSKY_PASS=
